The YAML 1.1 boolean word yes is written single-quoted, so readers reload it as the
string yes rather than a boolean.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md summary=yes
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
 status: backlog
+summary: 'yes'
 ---
 # My Plan
 
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: summary=yes
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
summary: 'yes'
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
